(What Is the Reason \(Underlying Etiology & Mechanisms\): Adolescent idiopathic) Tj
T*
(scoliosis \(80% of cases\) has multifactorial genetic and asymmetric growth plate) Tj
T*
(origins; adult degenerative scoliosis stems from asymmetric disc wear.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Immediate Action Plan \(What to Do Right Now for Relief\): Practice core) Tj
T*
(stabilization exercises, maintain upright sitting posture, and engage in low-) Tj
T*
(impact swimming to support paraspinal muscular balance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Proper Plan: How to Cure & Prevent \(Long-Term Management\): Undergo regular) Tj
T*
(orthopedic scoliosis monitoring; curves 25-40 degrees in growing adolescents) Tj
T*
(benefit from corrective bracing; curves >45-50 degrees may warrant surgery.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Red-Flag Warning Signs \(When to Seek Emergency Care\): Seek medical evaluation for) Tj
T*
(progressive shortness of breath, severe unremitting back pain, or progressive leg) Tj
T*
(numbness/weakness.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
